Requirements
  PHP >= 8.1 with curl, json and simplexml extensions
  Node.js + Playwright (optional, for chromium source support)

Installation
  Create log directory : mkdir -p /var/log/Curly && chmod 775 /var/log/Curly
  Writable tmp for cookies : /tmp must be writable (default on most systems)
  Set timezone in php.ini : date.timezone = Europe/Paris
  Check open_basedir in php.ini : must allow access to your log dir, tmp, and testcase files
  Chromium source only: set CURLY_CHROMIUM_SCRIPT=/path/to/curly-render.js if not using /opt/curly-render.js

Usage
  chmod +x Curly.php
  ./Curly.php --version
  ./Curly.php --help
  ./Curly.php conf/config.xml

